    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Adobe is a public company founded in 1982 and headquartered in San Jose, CA. Its website describes Adobe Express as an all-in-one design, photo, and video tool intended to make content creation easy, with the ability to produce social content, videos, and logos. The site also describes an AI Assistant feature that allows users to prompt, create, and edit content while preserving chosen elements.\n\nAdobe tracks several AI products across design, video, and audio categories. Adobe Firefly is its image generation model, described by the company as trained on commercially safe data. Adobe Express AI is a lighter design tool that integrates Firefly for quick content creation. Premiere Pro AI covers professional video editing with features such as generative extend and color match, also described as commercially safe. Adobe Podcast AI offers audio enhancement and speech improvement tools, again with a commercial-safe training claim attached.\n\nOn the filings side, Adobe is a publicly traded company on the record as ticker ADBE, with a CIK of 0000796343. Its most recent annual report, a 10-K filed for the period ending November 28, 2025, reported revenue of $23,769,000,000. The site's held facts show 174 law-related exposure entries associated with California, though no specific litigation cases are recorded in the current data.",
